msgstr ""
"<xref role=\"runtime\" linkend=\"adwaita-icon-theme\"/> e <xref "
"role=\"runtime\" linkend=\"gvfs\"/> (Para plugagem a quente e montagem de "
"dispositivos funcionem)"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><title>
#: blfs-en/gnome/platform/nautilus.xml:109
#, xml-text
msgid "Installation of Nautilus"
msgstr "Instalação do Nautilus"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><note><para>
#: blfs-en/gnome/platform/nautilus.xml:113
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"If you are upgrading from a previous version of this package, remove a "
"conflicting file by running the following command as the &root; user:"
msgstr ""
"Se você estiver atualizando a partir de uma versão anterior desse pacote, "
"remova um arquivo conflitante executando o seguinte comando como o(a) usante"
" &root;:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><note><screen>
#: blfs-en/gnome/platform/nautilus.xml:117
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput remap=\"pre\">rm -fv /usr/lib/libnautilus-"
"extension.so.4</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput remap=\"pre\">rm -fv /usr/lib/libnautilus-"
"extension.so.4</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/gnome/platform/nautilus.xml:121
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"Install <application>Nautilus</application> by running the following "
"commands:"
msgstr ""
"Instale o <application>Nautilus</application> executando os seguintes "
"comandos:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/gnome/platform/nautilus.xml:125
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>mkdir build &amp;&amp;\n"
"cd    build &amp;&amp;\n"
"\n"
"meson setup --prefix=/usr       \\\n"
"            --buildtype=release \\\n"
"            -D selinux=disabled \\\n"
"            ..                  &amp;&amp;\n"
"\n"
"ninja</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>mkdir build &amp;&amp;\n"
"cd    build &amp;&amp;\n"
"\n"
"meson setup --prefix=/usr       \\\n"
"            --buildtype=release \\\n"
"            -D selinux=disabled \\\n"
"            ..                  &amp;&amp;\n"
"\n"
"ninja</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/gnome/platform/nautilus.xml:136
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"If you have <xref linkend='gi-docgen'/> installed and you wish to generate "
"and install the API documentation, issue the following commands:"
msgstr ""
"Se você tiver <xref linkend='gi-docgen'/> instalado e desejar gerar e "
"instalar a documentação da API, emita os seguintes comandos:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/gnome/platform/nautilus.xml:141
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>sed \"/docdir =/s@\\$@ / 'nautilus-&nautilus-version;'@\" -i ../meson.build &amp;&amp;\n"
"meson configure -D docs=true &amp;&amp;\n"
"ninja</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>sed \"/docdir =/s@\\$@ / 'nautilus-&nautilus-version;'@\" -i ../meson.build &amp;&amp;\n"
"meson configure -D docs=true &amp;&amp;\n"
"ninja</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/gnome/platform/nautilus.xml:146
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"To test the results, issue: <command>ninja test</command>. The tests need to"
" be run in a graphical environment.  One test is known to fail if <xref "
"linkend=\"localsearch\"/> is not installed. One test is also known to "
"timeout if the user running the tests has a large home directory."
msgstr ""
"Para testar os resultados, emita: <command>ninja test</command>. Os testes "
"precisam ser executados em um ambiente gráfico. Um teste é conhecido por "
"falhar se o <xref linkend=\"localsearch\"/> não estiver instalado. Um teste "
"também é conhecido por atingir o tempo limite se o(a) usuário(a) executando "
"os testes tiver um diretório inicial grande."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/gnome/platform/nautilus.xml:153
#, xml-text
msgid "Now, as the <systemitem class=\"username\">root</systemitem> user:"
msgstr "Agora, como o(a) usante <systemitem class=\"username\">root</systemitem>:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/gnome/platform/nautilus.xml:156
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid "<userinput>ninja install</userinput>"
msgstr "<userinput>ninja install</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><title>
#: blfs-en/gnome/platform/nautilus.xml:164
#, xml-text
msgid "Command Explanations"
msgstr "Explicações do Comando"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/gnome/platform/nautilus.xml:170
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<option>-D cloudproviders=false</option>: Use this switch if you do not have"
" <xref linkend=\"libcloudproviders\"/> installed."
msgstr ""
"<option>-D cloudproviders=false</option>: Use essa chave se você não tiver "
"<xref linkend=\"libcloudproviders\"/> instalado."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/gnome/platform/nautilus.xml:175
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<option>-D tests=none</option>: Use this switch if you do not have <xref "
"linkend=\"localsearch\"/> installed.  But note that it would disable most "
"tests in the test suite, and Nautilus would fail to start until you install "
"<xref linkend=\"localsearch\"/>."
msgstr ""
"<option>-D tests=none</option>: Use essa chave se você não tiver <xref "
"linkend=\"localsearch\"/> instalado. Mas observe que isso desabilitaria a "
"maioria dos testes na suíte de teste e o Nautilus falharia para iniciar até "
"que você instalasse <xref linkend=\"localsearch\"/>."

